<title>FRANCE: Carrefour stock up on H1 results.</title>
<headline>Carrefour stock up on H1 results.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in retailer Carrefour were 1.15 percent higher at 2,728 francs at 0930 GMT after the group reported a 20 percent first-half pre-exceptional profit gain and predicted a similar full year earnings rise.</p>
<p>&quot;It's up on the results and the previous sales figures,&quot; reported by the company showing an 8.7 percent sales rise for August, a trader said.</p>
<p>The bourse's CAC-40 index was up 0.44 percent at the same time.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
